WEBVTT

00:08:28.292 --> 00:08:32.991
Now this of course doesn't mean I don't
come across any odd or bad situations.

00:08:32.991 --> 00:08:34.432
I certainly do.

00:08:34.912 --> 00:08:39.602
But facing them with even attitude
makes the whole difference.

00:08:40.372 --> 00:08:45.464
That's how, even though I have to
struggle hard for my basic rights,

00:08:45.464 --> 00:08:51.632
instead of being upset and angry,
I am happy and even to myself,

00:08:51.632 --> 00:08:56.662
because the struggle made me stronger,
made me who I am today.

00:08:58.172 --> 00:09:03.694
Now I have these learnings, these secrets
from all different multiplication tables.